        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "1F14453F0FBD244A",
      "text": "También he hecho mis sondeos en esta academia\\ny mucha gente parecía bastante interesada en ti.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "1F14463F0FBD25FD",
      "text": "Y, oye, ahora que te he conocido en persona,\\na mí también me parece una idea estupenda.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_09",
      "hash64": "2F8FCCC3B7EC6E12",
      "text": "¡Vaya! Me alegra oír eso, director Mirtilo.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "1F14433F0FBD20E4",
      "text": "¿Quieres pasar una temporada en mi academia?\\n¡Tu presencia sería todo un soplo de aire fresco![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_10",
      "hash64": "2F8C4FC3B7E963D4",
      "text": "Aquí donde lo ves, el director Mirtilo tiene muy\\nbuen ojo para la gente.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_11",
      "hash64": "2F8C50C3B7E96587",
      "text": "Si te parece bien, me gustaría que expandieses\\ntus horizontes en la Academia Arándano.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_12",
      "hash64": "2F8C51C3B7E9673A",
      "text": "¡Tómatelo como una búsqueda del tesoro extra![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_13",
      "hash64": "2F8C52C3B7E968ED",
      "text": "Me encantaría acompañarl[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, pero supongo que,\\ndejándol[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa bajo su supervisión, no tengo de qué\\r\\npreocuparme... ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
